OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny early morning cloud will
OL,6,Fsoon clear to bring a fine and dry day
OL,7,Fwith sunny spells. Feeling warm in the
OL,8,Fafternoon sunshine with light winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FA dry night with some lengthy
OL,11,Fclear spells, particularly at first.
OL,12,FBecoming chilly towards dawn with
OL,13,Fcloud amounts beginning to increase.
OL,14,
OL,15,CSunday:FSunday will begin dry with
OL,16,Fbright spells, but gradually becoming
OL,17,Fcloudier and breezier. Rain spreads
OL,18,Feast during the afternoon to leave a
OL,19,Fdry but chilly night with an easing
OL,20,Fwind.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
